    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glowing eyes are seen in the distance,\u00a0 and you start to hear the sounds of the undead approaching your location. You quickly scramble to find your pistol and barricade the windows as quickly as you can,\u00a0 but unfortunately it's too late.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A zombie outbreak is the last thing that you're expecting during World War II,\u00a0 but now it is your new reality.\u00a0 The only option you have left is to survive for as long as you can.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your pistol and any weapons that you can find in the environment around you to try and hold of the hordes of zombies.\u00a0 Traverse unknown locations and intense survival maps while annihilating the undead with the ultimate goal of surviving for as long as possible.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ZOMBIE SURVIVAL MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use classic weapons from World War II to fight zombies in thrilling environments and mysterious locations.\u00a0 Explore your surroundings to find secrets and survive for as long as possible while earning Steam Achievements and earning a higher position on the Steam Leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The zombies are more determined with every passing second,\u00a0 so you'll need to use your instincts in order to survive the zombie outbreak.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-Based Zombie Survival Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple HDRP Zombie Survival Maps &amp; Locations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Controller Support for PlayStation  and Xbox Controllers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glowing eyes are seen in the distance,\u00a0 and you start to hear the sounds of the undead approaching your location. You quickly scramble to find your pistol and barricade the windows as quickly as you can,\u00a0 but unfortunately it's too late.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A zombie outbreak is the last thing that you're expecting during World War II,\u00a0 but now it is your new reality.\u00a0 The only option you have left is to survive for as long as you can.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your pistol and any weapons that you can find in the environment around you to try and hold of the hordes of zombies.\u00a0 Traverse unknown locations and intense survival maps while annihilating the undead with the ultimate goal of surviving for as long as possible.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ZOMBIE SURVIVAL MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use classic weapons from World War II to fight zombies in thrilling environments and mysterious locations.\u00a0 Explore your surroundings to find secrets and survive for as long as possible while earning Steam Achievements and earning a higher position on the Steam Leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The zombies are more determined with every passing second,\u00a0 so you'll need to use your instincts in order to survive the zombie outbreak.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-Based Zombie Survival Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple HDRP Zombie Survival Maps &amp; Locations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Controller Support for PlayStation  and Xbox Controllers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
